y uh scan a qr  code on their phone  and only those with a green light were  allowed to proceed this was a city by  city system and it has been  um implemented in different ways it's  not a sort of  top-down you know uniform system  everywhere in china  but the system now is in place and even  though it's kind of  um been sort of scaled back  as the virus there has been quelled it  can quickly be called up  to be used later which is which is very  interesting  to continue watching this video click  the link in the top left or in the  description below  or visit iai dot tv for more debates and  talks from the world's leading thinkers  on today's biggest ideas

